 "notes": "Shore dive on the Oosterschelde below the Plompe Toren: the concrete steps down the dike, a band of stones and oyster beds along the slope and the 5/10/15/20 m contours of a steep, tidal slope that continues past 25 m. Dive steps and shoreline from OpenStreetMap; positions and contours are approximate. Strong current: dive around slack water, and move away if fishing boats come close.",
